    <briefdescription>
<para>A suite to contain a number of examples with UI. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><simplesect kind="author"><para>P. Lang </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="date"><para>2010</para>
</simplesect>
</para>
<sect1 id="namespacecsmp_1implementation">
<title>Implementation</title><para>Contains a map which holds one entry for each example category (<ref refid="_example_8h_source" kindref="compound">Example.h</ref> --&gt; category_) This map entry holds a pointer to a vector which in turn contains pointers to all examples registered to the suite of the respective category.</para>
</sect1>
<sect1 id="classcsmp_1_1_visitor_1examples">
<title>Application Examples</title><para><programlisting><codeline><highlight class="normal">...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>instantiating<sp/>ExampleSuite</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">ExampleSuite<sp/>exampleSuite(<sp/></highlight><highlight class="stringliteral">&quot;CSMP<sp/>EXAMPLES&quot;</highlight><highlight class="normal">,<sp/>&amp;cout<sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>register<sp/>new<sp/>example</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">exampleSuite.RegisterExample(<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">new</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>Example1ForSuite()<sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">...</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">exampleSuite.RegisterExample<sp/>(<sp/></highlight><highlight class="keyword">new</highlight><highlight class="normal"><sp/>YourExampleClass()<sp/>);</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal"></highlight><highlight class="comment">//<sp/>execute<sp/>examples<sp/>in<sp/>order<sp/>of<sp/>registration</highlight><highlight class="normal"></highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">exampleSuite.Execute();</highlight></codeline>
<codeline><highlight class="normal">...</highlight></codeline>
</programlisting> </para>
</sect1>
    </detaileddescription>
